  [3] Maren: "Since the flood the bell in the old belfry has been silent, and the marsh has gone dark and hungry."
  [4] action set fact heard_rumour = 1, start quest DrownedBell
  [5] choice 0) "How do I cross the marsh?" 1) "Where would I find a lantern?" 2) "I will go."
    choose 0 "How do I cross the marsh?":
      [6] Maren: "Warden Hale keeps the causeway gate and lets no one into Blackmere without a light. Past it, Odd's ferry, or the old punt by the jetty."
      (conversation ends)
    choose 1 "Where would I find a lantern?":
      [7] Maren: "Bram sells them at the inn. There was one in the barn once. And a clever hand can make one at the tinker's bench: an oil flask, and dried herbs for a wick."
      (conversation ends)
    choose 2 "I will go.":
      [8] Maren: "Then go with care. The marsh keeps what it takes."
      (conversation ends)
